(6650422, 993854, 141542, '<td valign="top">I can''t narrow it down, but I just prefer to think of it as the inside of someone''s brain, and for that you get an 8.</td>', 'I can''t narrow it down, but I just prefer to think of it as the inside of someone''s brain, and for that you get an 8.', '2012-01-20 09:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
