(6650426, 993779, 141542, '<td valign="top">I really do love this shot, and it''s texture is just edible.  Well done!  8.</td>', 'I really do love this shot, and it''s texture is just edible.  Well done!  8.', '2012-01-20 09:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650427, 993856, 141542, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Appropriately filled with mystery and sinisterly rigid.</td>', 'Excellent.  Appropriately filled with mystery and sinisterly rigid.', '2012-01-20 09:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650428, 993633, 141542, '<td valign="top">I added one point just for the guts to bring your camera in.  Well done.</td>', 'I added one point just for the guts to bring your camera in.  Well done.', '2012-01-20 09:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650429, 993753, 141542, '<td valign="top">Beuatiful textures and the rusted tip is just enough color to really draw the eye in.  A great capture!</td>', 'Beuatiful textures and the rusted tip is just enough color to really draw the eye in.  A great capture!', '2012-01-20 09:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650434, 993714, 141542, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, which is what I''m sure you''re trying to achieve.  The top right of the upper leaf is a bit too bright I think, which seems to cut off the lower half of that leaf in a strange way.  Still a great shot, though.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, which is what I''m sure you''re trying to achieve.  The top right of the upper leaf is a bit too bright I think, which seems to cut off the lower half of that leaf in a strange way.  Still a great shot, though.', '2012-01-20 09:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650436, 993770, 141542, '<td valign="top">Whimsical wine is what we witness here.  ALLITERATION!  7!</td>', 'Whimsical wine is what we witness here.  ALLITERATION!  7!', '2012-01-20 09:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650437, 993852, 141542, '<td valign="top">I was hoping there''d be more intensity in the images, like this one.  7!  Very good.</td>', 'I was hoping there''d be more intensity in the images, like this one.  7!  Very good.', '2012-01-20 09:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650439, 993325, 141542, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love that miniscule light under the massive monolith that makes up this image.  Well composed.</td>', 'I absolutely love that miniscule light under the massive monolith that makes up this image.  Well composed.', '2012-01-20 09:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650441, 993838, 141542, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2012-01-20 09:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650444, 992856, 141542, '<td valign="top">Preeminent image of the challenge.  One of the few cases where I''d put a pet in that category also.  Perfectly composed, a wonderful story which connects us directly to the image emotionally, and gorgeous light.  This is photography.</td>', 'Preeminent image of the challenge.  One of the few cases where I''d put a pet in that category also.  Perfectly composed, a wonderful story which connects us directly to the image emotionally, and gorgeous light.  This is photography.', '2012-01-20 09:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650469, 993338, 87808, '<td valign="top">I totally love this, hard gritty, looks like you should be on a Mickey Spillane book cover</td>', 'I totally love this, hard gritty, looks like you should be on a Mickey Spillane book cover', '2012-01-20 10:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650474, 993767, 87808, '<td valign="top">There are several reasons I love this shot, it is simple, plain and just chock full of interest. In myself, you provoked the immediate response of Freddy Mercury, So ''Bohemian Rhapsody''  So with this shot,  you transported me to a happy place and a reminder of something else.  SO very very well done.<br/> <br/> <br/>//www.youtube.com/watch?v=fJ9rUzIMcZQ</td>', 'There are several reasons I love this shot, it is simple, plain and just chock full of interest. In myself, you provoked the immediate response of Freddy Mercury, So ''Bohemian Rhapsody''  So with this shot,  you transported me to a happy place and a reminder of something else.  SO very very well done.  //www.youtube.com/watch?v=fJ9rUzIMcZQ', '2012-01-20 10:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650475, 993641, 87808, '<td valign="top">I really like this, emotive, made me smile, well done</td>', 'I really like this, emotive, made me smile, well done', '2012-01-20 10:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650478, 993288, 16912, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing your heading for a dq with this but hope I''m wrong! I also hope other voters see the absolute genius in the conception of this shot (a new take on the wine glasses/witches).<br/> <br/>My only <b>10</b> of the challenge (thus far) and looking forward to the ''how I did this'' at the end of voting.</td>', 'I''m guessing your heading for a dq with this but hope I''m wrong! I also hope other voters see the absolute genius in the conception of this shot (a new take on the wine glasses/witches). My only 10 of the challenge (thus far) and looking forward to the ''how I did this'' at the end of voting.', '2012-01-20 10:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650516, 993828, 118154, '<td valign="top">That,s lovely.</td>', 'That,s lovely.', '2012-01-20 11:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650520, 993742, 118154, '<td valign="top">That is real cute,nice idea.</td>', 'That is real cute,nice idea.', '2012-01-20 11:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650521, 993740, 118154, '<td valign="top">Not sure how you did this? but it looks very good.</td>', 'Not sure how you did this? but it looks very good.', '2012-01-20 11:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650541, 993775, 19825, '<td valign="top">You see a fair number of splash/drop shots on DPC, and generally my excitement over them has ebbed over time. However, you have renewed my awe with this shot. It is amazing.</td>', 'You see a fair number of splash/drop shots on DPC, and generally my excitement over them has ebbed over time. However, you have renewed my awe with this shot. It is amazing.', '2012-01-20 11:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650553, 993641, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh golly!   Are you... NEKKID!?!!<br/> <br/> <br/>*eek*</td>', 'Oh golly!   Are you... NEKKID!?!!  *eek*', '2012-01-20 12:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650554, 993779, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love it!</td>', 'I love it!', '2012-01-20 12:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650555, 993288, 86447, '<td valign="top">Way, WAY, WAAAY Too cool!</td>', 'Way, WAY, WAAAY Too cool!', '2012-01-20 12:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650556, 992856, 86447, '<td valign="top">Ha!</td>', 'Ha!', '2012-01-20 12:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650630, 993752, 113156, '<td valign="top">Don''t like this, it makes me want to pat his head but I can''t, nice one.</td>', 'Don''t like this, it makes me want to pat his head but I can''t, nice one.', '2012-01-20 13:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650632, 993738, 113156, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity, light no light, spot on.</td>', 'Love the simplicity, light no light, spot on.', '2012-01-20 13:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650637, 993641, 10785, '<td valign="top">Looking through the pinhole?? Silvery tones, great contrast and light, good and rugged male self portrait!</td>', 'Looking through the pinhole?? Silvery tones, great contrast and light, good and rugged male self portrait!', '2012-01-20 13:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650639, 993844, 10785, '<td valign="top">Though I can see the light reflected in the drops, this type of shot does not show off the light by showing the highlights and shadows, etc. I like the shot, though it is lacking in contrast. There is also some hair and grime on the glass which should be cleaned better for a shot like this. (I run into that problem all the time when I shoot glass and mirrors. I hear the trick is to use a coffee filter!)</td>', 'Though I can see the light reflected in the drops, this type of shot does not show off the light by showing the highlights and shadows, etc. I like the shot, though it is lacking in contrast. There is also some hair and grime on the glass which should be cleaned better for a shot like this. (I run into that problem all the time when I shoot glass and mirrors. I hear the trick is to use a coffee filter!)', '2012-01-20 14:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650641, 993742, 109363, '<td valign="top">more like, "Mickey Ouch!"</td>', 'more like, "Mickey Ouch!"', '2012-01-20 14:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650642, 993411, 10785, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of space in the image. I think the composition might have been stronger with a lower camera angle looking up at the model. The wind and the smokey background strongly depicts the storm, but then the camera angle makes the model appear like she is just standing there posing... the strength of her resistance to the storm does not show. I like the green and yellow colors which pop off the background!</td>', 'There is a lot of space in the image. I think the composition might have been stronger with a lower camera angle looking up at the model. The wind and the smokey background strongly depicts the storm, but then the camera angle makes the model appear like she is just standing there posing... the strength of her resistance to the storm does not show. I like the green and yellow colors which pop off the background!', '2012-01-20 14:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650644, 993601, 10785, '<td valign="top">The lighting really has a great film noir feel to it. The shot needs some people at the bottom of the stairs acting out a scene to feel more complete.</td>', 'The lighting really has a great film noir feel to it. The shot needs some people at the bottom of the stairs acting out a scene to feel more complete.', '2012-01-20 14:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650645, 993779, 109363, '<td valign="top">love the simplicity</td>', 'love the simplicity', '2012-01-20 14:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650646, 993464, 109363, '<td valign="top">the vase is a bit distracting</td>', 'the vase is a bit distracting', '2012-01-20 14:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650649, 993575, 109363, '<td valign="top">technically, i''d say there are 2 lights there...</td>', 'technically, i''d say there are 2 lights there...', '2012-01-20 14:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650657, 992850, 143210, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2012-01-20 14:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650660, 993285, 94265, '<td valign="top">Effective DOF and great focus, I love these little figures. Nice lighting. The only thing I don''t like is the super thin border, I don''t think the image needs it, definitely doesn''t need it in red. A high scorer for me, 8.</td>', 'Effective DOF and great focus, I love these little figures. Nice lighting. The only thing I don''t like is the super thin border, I don''t think the image needs it, definitely doesn''t need it in red. A high scorer for me, 8.', '2012-01-20 14:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650662, 993769, 94265, '<td valign="top">Love the abstract here, very nice work.</td>', 'Love the abstract here, very nice work.', '2012-01-20 14:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650664, 993749, 109363, '<td valign="top">hmmm... looks like 2 lights to me.... nice composition, though</td>', 'hmmm... looks like 2 lights to me.... nice composition, though', '2012-01-20 14:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650666, 992734, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not keen on the model''s expression as I don''t think she looks remotely comfortable. Other than that, lovely photo; I like the styling and colours, good composition, great light, nice and sharp.</td>', 'I''m not keen on the model''s expression as I don''t think she looks remotely comfortable. Other than that, lovely photo; I like the styling and colours, good composition, great light, nice and sharp.', '2012-01-20 14:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650669, 993749, 94265, '<td valign="top">The flame is a bit blown out and the red glare from it is annoying but the composition is good and the focus is nice, I like the feel of the shot overall. I do wish the candle was on the desk though, I would never place a candle on a flammable book and I doubt many others would either!</td>', 'The flame is a bit blown out and the red glare from it is annoying but the composition is good and the focus is nice, I like the feel of the shot overall. I do wish the candle was on the desk though, I would never place a candle on a flammable book and I doubt many others would either!', '2012-01-20 14:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650672, 993453, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very good capture, nice and sharp on the child, I like the light very much. Who doesn''t love bubbles?</td>', 'Very good capture, nice and sharp on the child, I like the light very much. Who doesn''t love bubbles?', '2012-01-20 14:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650674, 993641, 94265, '<td valign="top">A wee tad noisy in the background but this has good focus and a lot of character, a nice friendly face. I''m not usually a fan of square crops personally but it''s Ok here. I like the even light. Good work, a 7.</td>', 'A wee tad noisy in the background but this has good focus and a lot of character, a nice friendly face. I''m not usually a fan of square crops personally but it''s Ok here. I like the even light. Good work, a 7.', '2012-01-20 14:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650675, 993765, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not feeling the angle, I think I''d have preferred to see more of the sky above the light and less of the road in front of it, the sky being more attractive in my mind. Still, awesome light spray, nice clear focus, lovely golden tones. Good shot.</td>', 'I''m not feeling the angle, I think I''d have preferred to see more of the sky above the light and less of the road in front of it, the sky being more attractive in my mind. Still, awesome light spray, nice clear focus, lovely golden tones. Good shot.', '2012-01-20 14:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650679, 993752, 94265, '<td valign="top">Lovely old fellow, nice focus, a cute shot. :-)</td>', 'Lovely old fellow, nice focus, a cute shot. :-)', '2012-01-20 14:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650685, 993779, 100393, '<td valign="top">As an AJHopp fan - I appreciate the effort.</td>', 'As an AJHopp fan - I appreciate the effort.', '2012-01-20 14:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650687, 993768, 19825, '<td valign="top">Simple yet elegant. This evokes quite a mood.</td>', 'Simple yet elegant. This evokes quite a mood.', '2012-01-20 14:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650688, 993836, 19825, '<td valign="top">Nice mix of tones and textures.</td>', 'Nice mix of tones and textures.', '2012-01-20 15:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650714, 993758, 19825, '<td valign="top">The look on his face suits the mood of the lighting perfectly. The tones on his skin are great. Nice shot.<br/> <br/>I was thinking I needed to get a new model, but perhaps we should just trade models for a spell. That might confuse people. Ellie would love to visit Australia. I am sure you could provide her with some stunning portraits she could post to her Facebook account.</td>', 'The look on his face suits the mood of the lighting perfectly. The tones on his skin are great. Nice shot. I was thinking I needed to get a new model, but perhaps we should just trade models for a spell. That might confuse people. Ellie would love to visit Australia. I am sure you could provide her with some stunning portraits she could post to her Facebook account.', '2012-01-20 15:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650718, 993567, 133853, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo. Great job...</td>', 'Lovely photo. Great job...', '2012-01-20 15:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6650720, 993770, 19825, '<td valign="top">Creative idea and impressive execution.</td>', 'Creative idea and impressive execution.', '2012-01-20 15:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
