(6652711, 992734, 114233, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96751" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tanguera</a>??<br/>This happens to be my first image that comes up for voting but just brezzing thru the thumbnails this one looks destined for the front page. Lovely lighting. Comp is top notch. Processing is not over the top and looks very natural. I love how the curves of the hat make the pattern just vanish into the black BG.<br/>Lovely well done</td>', ' tanguera??This happens to be my first image that comes up for voting but just brezzing thru the thumbnails this one looks destined for the front page. Lovely lighting. Comp is top notch. Processing is not over the top and looks very natural. I love how the curves of the hat make the pattern just vanish into the black BG.Lovely well done', '2012-01-23 08:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6652712, 993589, 114233, '<td valign="top">Nice classic old style portrait. The colours are quite fitting of that era too. Lovely shot tho<br/>My only problems are: the skin looks a little too smooth and unnatural and the background seems to have been worked on. BG on models right looks to have been darkened but it has crept on the clothing as well. The masking is not accurate enough.</td>', 'Nice classic old style portrait. The colours are quite fitting of that era too. Lovely shot thoMy only problems are: the skin looks a little too smooth and unnatural and the background seems to have been worked on. BG on models right looks to have been darkened but it has crept on the clothing as well. The masking is not accurate enough.', '2012-01-23 08:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6652987, 992734, 23484, '<td valign="top">I think that one softbox did a great job .</td>', 'I think that one softbox did a great job .', '2012-01-23 13:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6652989, 993838, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice job, great b&amp;w.</td>', 'Nice job, great b&w.', '2012-01-23 13:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
