(6653822, 993398, 140305, '<td valign="top">I like how the copper pitcher, the tablecloth and the wallpaper go together, but the candle holder seems too modern and out of place. I think maybe a plain caramel-colored stubby candle may have worked better. Just a thought.</td>', 'I like how the copper pitcher, the tablecloth and the wallpaper go together, but the candle holder seems too modern and out of place. I think maybe a plain caramel-colored stubby candle may have worked better. Just a thought.', '2012-01-24 12:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653825, 993795, 140305, '<td valign="top">Very pretty...love the colors!</td>', 'Very pretty...love the colors!', '2012-01-24 12:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653832, 993465, 140305, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen this with his ear less lit. To me it takes too much attention from his face. Other than that I love the clothing and the expression. This makes me think of a Charles Dickens character.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen this with his ear less lit. To me it takes too much attention from his face. Other than that I love the clothing and the expression. This makes me think of a Charles Dickens character.', '2012-01-24 12:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
