(6653889, 992730, 143086, '<td valign="top">I love this dog!<br/> <br/>K, the photo is pretty good, I like the hard lighting, but I''d like it better if the hindquarters were also in focus, and the front paws were not cropped.</td>', 'I love this dog! K, the photo is pretty good, I like the hard lighting, but I''d like it better if the hindquarters were also in focus, and the front paws were not cropped.', '2012-01-24 14:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653893, 993601, 143086, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. To me, it''s a bit too busy. Perhaps if you''d removed the rug and the stuff around the door. Maybe cropped the top and left hand side to focus more on the opening? But it''s cool that the light is coming from the (probable) living room, and the pov is in the dark</td>', 'I like this photo. To me, it''s a bit too busy. Perhaps if you''d removed the rug and the stuff around the door. Maybe cropped the top and left hand side to focus more on the opening? But it''s cool that the light is coming from the (probable) living room, and the pov is in the dark', '2012-01-24 14:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653897, 993757, 143086, '<td valign="top">haha cool! I like the striping from the shadows that the solder nodes cast. And the direction of the arrow. Nice use of hard light. <br/> <br/>At first I thought it was a sign where you push the white letters into the black background, like at a cafeteria, then I saw the title and figured it out.</td>', 'haha cool! I like the striping from the shadows that the solder nodes cast. And the direction of the arrow. Nice use of hard light.  At first I thought it was a sign where you push the white letters into the black background, like at a cafeteria, then I saw the title and figured it out.', '2012-01-24 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653902, 993338, 143086, '<td valign="top">the hard shadows are pretty good, though the axis of the source is not perpendicular to the face''s line of symmetry, and so the bottom half of the face looks bent. Not a bad thing in and of itself, but it doesn''t jive with the title. The sparse monobrow could have been removed too, since it''s distracting. The bridge of the nose is clipped. I''m not sure what the photo is trying to evoke.</td>', 'the hard shadows are pretty good, though the axis of the source is not perpendicular to the face''s line of symmetry, and so the bottom half of the face looks bent. Not a bad thing in and of itself, but it doesn''t jive with the title. The sparse monobrow could have been removed too, since it''s distracting. The bridge of the nose is clipped. I''m not sure what the photo is trying to evoke.', '2012-01-24 14:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653907, 992768, 143086, '<td valign="top">She''s pretty. But the photo is kinda flat. The eyelashes cast a shadow on her eyes which obfuscates the best feature.</td>', 'She''s pretty. But the photo is kinda flat. The eyelashes cast a shadow on her eyes which obfuscates the best feature.', '2012-01-24 14:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653913, 993856, 143086, '<td valign="top">nice photo. I like that we are in the dark and the lit room is closed to us. If there were people in the room I''d feel more sympathetic.</td>', 'nice photo. I like that we are in the dark and the lit room is closed to us. If there were people in the room I''d feel more sympathetic.', '2012-01-24 14:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653924, 993768, 143086, '<td valign="top">this evokes all sorts of spooky feelings!</td>', 'this evokes all sorts of spooky feelings!', '2012-01-24 15:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653929, 993721, 143086, '<td valign="top">I like the drops on the nice deep red of the pepper. Very well done. The smoke isn''t working for me though. Maybe there''s too much, or it''s too obviously coming from behind the pepper. It''s a bell pepper, right? Which are sweet-tasting...not hot...maybe that''s a picky detail but it''s distracting</td>', 'I like the drops on the nice deep red of the pepper. Very well done. The smoke isn''t working for me though. Maybe there''s too much, or it''s too obviously coming from behind the pepper. It''s a bell pepper, right? Which are sweet-tasting...not hot...maybe that''s a picky detail but it''s distracting', '2012-01-24 15:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653932, 993404, 143086, '<td valign="top">a bit too cartoonish for me...too much clipping on both ends.</td>', 'a bit too cartoonish for me...too much clipping on both ends.', '2012-01-24 15:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653942, 993698, 143086, '<td valign="top">Lots of colourful graininess on the pages which is pretty a bad thing. The key effect is well done.</td>', 'Lots of colourful graininess on the pages which is pretty a bad thing. The key effect is well done.', '2012-01-24 15:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653945, 993453, 143086, '<td valign="top">nice lighting. I would give higher numbers if the fast-moving bubbles weren''t blurry. I think it would have been more dramatic if you''d cropped the back half of the boy, and some off the top or bottom maybe....</td>', 'nice lighting. I would give higher numbers if the fast-moving bubbles weren''t blurry. I think it would have been more dramatic if you''d cropped the back half of the boy, and some off the top or bottom maybe....', '2012-01-24 15:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653983, 993589, 143086, '<td valign="top">very nice. There''s a bit of a strange glow around the left hand edges, maybe the light is a bit too intense on her cheek as well. The dress is a bit too busy in the torso which distracts from the gorgeous face and hair.</td>', 'very nice. There''s a bit of a strange glow around the left hand edges, maybe the light is a bit too intense on her cheek as well. The dress is a bit too busy in the torso which distracts from the gorgeous face and hair.', '2012-01-24 17:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6653988, 993493, 143086, '<td valign="top">very nice! This is gorgeous. The shadows on her face are subtle. The shoulder/back is a bit too blurred, and there''s some jpeg-i-ness there too.</td>', 'very nice! This is gorgeous. The shadows on her face are subtle. The shoulder/back is a bit too blurred, and there''s some jpeg-i-ness there too.', '2012-01-24 17:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
